# Bolt Bend targets "a spell or ability with a single target" (CR 115.1). Bot1's Untimely Malfunction (third mode) targets
# both of Bot2's Ornithopters: two targets, so Bot2's Bolt Bend (all four Moxen untapped, so mana is no reason) cannot be
# cast at it (the refusal). Bot1's Lightning Bolt at Bot2 has a single target (the positive control): Bolt Bend is cast and
# redirects it: the Bolt now has other legal targets (Bot1 and the three Ornithopters), so Bot2 is asked and picks Bot1.
# The Bolt's damage proves the redirect: Bot1 17, Bot2 20 (it would be 20 and 17 had it not changed).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Untimely Malfunction
Lightning Bolt
Ornithopter
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Bolt Bend
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x13

